## Executive Summary

Successfully implemented complete Data Classification and Threat Modeling modules for the Executive Cyber Responsibility Platform. This enables executives to understand data at risk (PHI, PII, PCI) and threats targeting crown jewel processes, feeding the correlation engine's ability to translate technical findings into business impact narratives.

## Components Delivered

### Backend Services (cyberrx-api/src/)

#### 1. Data Classification Module
