  - Organization scope enforcement

- **Routes:** `/Users/briandibassinga/Github/Cyber-Rx/cyberrx-api/src/routes/dataObjects.js`
  - GET /api/data-objects - List with filters (type, sensitivity, businessProcessId)
  - GET /api/data-objects/:id - Get single data object
  - POST /api/data-objects - Create data object
  - PUT /api/data-objects/:id - Update data object
  - DELETE /api/data-objects/:id - Delete data object
  - GET /api/data-objects/asset/:assetId - Get by asset
  - GET /api/data-objects/application/:applicationId - Get by application
  - GET /api/data-objects/control/:controlId - Get by control
  - GET /api/data-objects/high-value - Get high-value data (PHI/PII/PCI Critical/High)
  - GET /api/data-objects/summary/classification - Classification summary
  - GET /api/data-objects/process-map - Process map for visualization

